   "shape_m": "ol",
   "html_text": "The sense-world is a product of our organisation. Our visible (bodily) organs are, like all other parts of the phenomenal world, only pictures of an unknown object. The transcendent basis of our organisation remains therefore just as unknown to us as the things which act upon it. We have always before us only the product of both. (Lange 1873–75, 3: 219)",
